                     <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//DocumentVersionRelationship[@uid]"&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelating" value="../@uid"/&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelated" value="Related/@uidRef"/&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:assert test="not(../@uid = Related/@uidRef)"&gt;&#xD; The related DocumentVersion and the relating DocumentVersion shall be different. &#xD; {&#xD; -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt;&#xD; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; &#xD; -rule_name:DocumentVersionRelationship.WR1&#xD; -relating:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelating"/&gt;&#xD; -related:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelated"/&gt;&#xD; }&#xD; &lt;/sch:assert&gt;&#xD; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <body>Schematron</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459327653235_429264_42552"
                             xmi:uuid="d2af261b-39e8-4150-8617-3d3300ea5d44"
                             xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459327614408_519135_42550"/>
                  <body>the related DocumentVersion and the relating DocumentVersion shall be different.</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <name>WR1</name>
               <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193081_99909_23530"/>
               <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1509113469930_380861_31135"
                              xmi:uuid="0e4c6272-9b79-4b71-8eb5-cdd40ec11fff"
                              xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
                  <body>self.Relating &lt;&gt; self.Related</body>
                  <language>OCL2.0</language>
               </specification>
            </ownedRule>
