                     <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//MatedPartRelationship[@uid]"&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelating" value="../@uid"/&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelated" value="Related/@uidRef"/&gt;&#xD; &lt;sch:assert test="not(../@uid = Related/@uidRef)"&gt;&#xD; The related MatedPart and the relating MatedPart shall be different. &#xD; {&#xD; -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt;&#xD; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; &#xD; -rule_name:MatedPartRelationship.WR1&#xD; -relating:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelating"/&gt;&#xD; -related:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelated"/&gt;&#xD; }&#xD; &lt;/sch:assert&gt;&#xD; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <body>Schematron</body>
               </ownedComment>
